  "releaseNotes": "Session Lifecycle Optimization:\n      - Moved session runtime data into SessionInfo for better DOD alignment and cache efficiency.\n      - Removed legacy session mask validation and redundant per-request session checks.\n      - Session registration now occurs only once during connection establishment.\n      - Improved KeepAlive cleanup through unified receive-error disconnect handling.\n      - Fixed network resource leaks and improved long-term stability under heavy load.",
